# Worker Context

This file is injected into every Claude Code worker workspace as `CLAUDE.md`.
Copy to `worker-CLAUDE.md` and customise for your stack. (The real file is gitignored.)

---

## What is Donkai?

Donkai (donkey work + AI) automatically picks up Linear tickets in the
**Ready for Claude** state and completes engineering work using Claude Code.
When a ticket moves into that state, the orchestrator spawns a worker that reads
the ticket, clones repos, does the work, opens a PR, and signals completion.

---

## Your repositories

<!-- List the repos workers may need to clone. Example: -->

All repos are under the `yourorg` GitHub org. Clone via SSH:

```bash
git clone git@github.com:yourorg/<repo-name>.git
```

| Repo | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `your-app` | Main application |
| `your-infra` | Infrastructure / Terraform |

